-cotta"],["Passatelli","dish/passatelli"],["Pecorino","dish/pecorino"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/3/38/Bomboloni_con_marmellata.jpg/500px-Bomboloni_con_marmellata.jpg","w":500,"h":333,"by":"Gail","lic":"CC BY 2.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bomboloni_con_marmellata.jpg"}},"ingredient/turkey-meat":{"t":"ingredient","r":"ingredient/turkey-meat","n":"Turkey meat","c":"#c9b8dd","crumb":[["Ingredients","ingredients"]],"sub":"Ingredient in 4 dishes across 5 cuisines","intro":[["Turkey meat, commonly referred to simply as turkey, is the meat from turkeys, typically domesticated ones, but also wild turkeys. It is a popular poultry dish, especially in North America and the United Kingdom, where it is traditionally consumed as part of culturally significant events such as Thanksgiving and Christmas as well as in standard cuisine."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-turkey-meat"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turkey_meat"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":5,"groups":[["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine",[["Club sandwich","dish/club-sandwich"]]],["Arab cuisine","cuisine/arab-cuisine",[["Shawarma","dish/shawarma"]]],["Guatemalan cuisine","cuisine/guatemalan-cuisine",[["Kak'ik","dish/kak-ik"]]],["Maya cuisine","cuisine/maya-cuisine",[["Kak'ik","dish/kak-ik"]]],["Polish cuisine","cuisine/polish-cuisine",[["Kotlet schabowy","dish/kotlet-schabowy"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Chicken","ingredient/chicken"],["Tomato","ingredient/tomato"],["Bacon","ingredient/bacon"],["Lettuce","ingredient/lettuce"],["Mayonnaise","ingredient/mayonnaise"],["Toast","ingredient/toast"],["Turkey as food","ingredient/turkey-as-food"],["Black pepper","ingredient/black-pepper"],["Breadcrumbs","ingredient/breadcrumbs"],["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Lard","ingredient/lard"],["Pork","ingredient/pork"],["Pork loin","ingredient/pork-lo